# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DOWNLOADED 3D-MODEL SOURCE THE CARVE PIPELINE NEVER READS
#
# 387 MB of it went into the repo with one `git add` (cdd025b) and had to come
# straight back out; the delete does NOT shrink .git, because the blobs stay in
# history. This is here so the next asset download cannot repeat it.
#
# NOT ignored, because they ARE the pipeline's inputs: car_voxelize.py reads one
# mesh per recipe and tools/*/*.json names it by filename - .obj .fbx .stl .glb
# .3ds are all live inputs today. Only the EDITABLE source and the download
# archives that sit beside them are ignored. Need one anyway: `git add -f <path>`.
*.blend
*.blend1
*.rar
*.7z
assets/**/*.zip
